flowchart TD
    A[Start Application] --> B[Load config and setup ZEN connection]
    B --> C{ZEN_UI_START?}

    C -->|true| D[Create selector UI and populate experiments]
    C -->|false| E[Auto-start configured experiment and monitor global frames]

    D --> F{User selects mode}
    F -->|Display only| DISP_START{How acquisition starts?}
    F -->|OME-ZARR only| ZARR_START[User clicks Start in napari]

    %% === Display only path ===
    DISP_START -->|User clicks Start in napari| G[Load and prepare selected experiment]
    DISP_START -->|User starts in ZEN Blue| H[Frames arrive without UI experiment ID]
    DISP_START -->|User clicks Stop in napari| STOP[Stop experiment via API, close progress bar, trigger restructure]

    G --> G1[Arm FrameData experiment ID filter]
    G1 --> GSTART[Start loaded experiment via API]
    GSTART --> G2[Store ID and start status monitor task]
    G2 --> I[StreamingPipeline receives frames]

    E --> I
    H --> I

    I --> IFILTER{Target experiment ID armed?}
    IFILTER -->|No, ZEN-started| J{First frame of new acquisition?}
    IFILTER -->|Yes, ID matches| J
    IFILTER -->|Yes, ID differs| IDROP[Ignore unrelated frame]
    IDROP --> I
    J -->|Yes| J1[Clear existing layers and reset frame storage]
    J -->|No| K[Cancel pending restructure check task]
    J1 --> K

    K --> K1[Extract live FramePosition S,T,M,Z,C]
    K1 --> L[Store under sparse key S,T,M,Z,C and update last_frame_time]
    L --> M[Create or update linear 7D streaming layer]
    M --> N[Start new restructure check task]

    N --> O{current_experiment_id set?}
    O -->|Yes| P["Poll monitor_all_experiments —\nwait for is_experiment_running = false"]
    O -->|No| Q[Wait ZEN_RESTRUCTURE_TIMEOUT default 10.0s]

    P --> R[perform_restructure]
    Q --> Q1{No frames during timeout?}
    Q1 -->|No| N
    Q1 -->|Yes| R
    STOP --> R

    R --> R1[Set is_streaming false]
    R1 --> R2[Remove streaming layer]
    R2 --> R3[Merge M tiles into one 5D STZYX mosaic per channel]
    R3 --> R4[Set axis labels S,T,Z,Y,X]
    R4 --> S

    %% Channel filter (Display only, any time)
    CHFILT["Channel filter combo box\n(0–31 or All channels)"] -->|valueChanged| CHFILT1[Update _effective_channel_index]
    CHFILT1 --> CHFILT2[Restart pipeline reader\nsuspend_reader + resume_reader]

    %% === OME-ZARR only path ===
    ZARR_START --> ZARR_VALIDATE{Experiment selected?}
    ZARR_VALIDATE -->|No| ZARR_ERR[Show error and re-enable Start]
    ZARR_VALIDATE -->|Yes| ZARR_OVERRIDE[Build ecfg from UI settings and exported XML dimensions and wells]
    ZARR_OVERRIDE --> ZARR_AUTOTRIG{Auto-trigger\nchecked?}
    ZARR_AUTOTRIG -->|Yes| ZARR_CALL["Call stream_to_omezarr_with_config(ecfg) — same function as CLI"]
    ZARR_AUTOTRIG -->|No| ZARR_ARMED["Writer Armed —\nwait for ZEN to start experiment"]
    ZARR_ARMED --> ZARR_CALL
    ZARR_CALL --> ZARR_GRPC[Create dedicated gRPC channel]
    ZARR_GRPC --> ZARR_STREAM[Open monitor_all_experiments stream per source channel]
    ZARR_STREAM --> ZARR_TRIGEXP{Auto-trigger?}
    ZARR_TRIGEXP -->|Yes| ZARR_EXP[Start experiment via API]
    ZARR_TRIGEXP -->|No| ZARR_FIRST[Wait for first frame]
    ZARR_EXP --> ZARR_FIRST
    ZARR_FIRST --> ZARR_STATUS[Query live T,C,Z,S,M counts; exported XML is fallback]
    ZARR_STATUS --> ZARR_MAP[Build expected coordinate map in T,S,M,C,Z append order]
    ZARR_MAP --> ZARR_LOOP[Read frame and form key from FramePosition T,S,M,Z plus subscription C]
    ZARR_LOOP --> ZARR_VALID{Key in expected map?}
    ZARR_VALID -->|No| ZARR_SKIP[Skip unexpected frame]
    ZARR_SKIP --> ZARR_LOOP
    ZARR_VALID -->|Yes| ZARR_DUP{Coordinate already received?}
    ZARR_DUP -->|Yes| ZARR_IGNORE[Ignore duplicate frame]
    ZARR_IGNORE --> ZARR_LOOP
    ZARR_DUP -->|No| ZARR_PENDING[Capture S,M geometry and buffer raw frame or HCS scene plane]
    ZARR_PENDING --> ZARR_APPEND[Append consecutive frames or completed HCS scene planes]
    ZARR_APPEND --> ZARR_DONE{All unique expected coordinates received?}
    ZARR_DONE -->|No| ZARR_TIMEOUT{Inactivity timeout?}
    ZARR_TIMEOUT -->|No| ZARR_LOOP
    ZARR_TIMEOUT -->|Yes| ZARR_FINISH[Drain pending frames, skip missing slots, close stream]
    ZARR_DONE -->|Yes| ZARR_FINISH
    ZARR_FINISH --> ZARR_LAYOUT{Explicit HCS plate?}
    ZARR_LAYOUT -->|Yes| ZARR_HCS[Finalize directly written HCS wells and row groups]
    ZARR_LAYOUT -->|No, multiple S or M| ZARR_SCENES[Group raw tiles by streamed S and identify each tile by M]
    ZARR_LAYOUT -->|No, single image| S
    ZARR_SCENES --> ZARR_PLACE[Place from streamed XYZ and scale; higher M wins overlaps]
    ZARR_PLACE --> ZARR_SERIES[Advertise one TCZYX mosaic per scene; optionally retain raw tiles]
    ZARR_HCS --> S
    ZARR_SERIES --> S

    %% === Common finish ===
    S[on_experiment_finished]
    S --> S0[Close any stale progress bar]
    S0 --> S1[Show start button and hide stop button]
    S1 --> S2[Cancel status monitor and clear experiment ID and frame filter]
    S2 --> T[Ready for next acquisition]

    T --> D

    style D fill:#e1f5ff
    style E fill:#ffe1e1
    style R fill:#d4edda
    style ZARR_CALL fill:#e8daef
    style ZARR_LOOP fill:#e8daef
    style ZARR_FINISH fill:#e8daef
    style ZARR_SCENES fill:#d4edda
    style ZARR_PLACE fill:#d4edda
    style ZARR_ARMED fill:#f5e6ff
    style CHFILT fill:#e1f5e1
    style S fill:#fff3cd